Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 22:48:24 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] mshtml: text range sentence and textedit units, bookmarks;
 markup pointer units

IHTMLTxtRange move, moveStart, moveEnd and expand know the sentence unit
(ends with . ! or ? and the white space after it) and move/moveStart/moveEnd
know textedit (the whole body text: a positive count goes to the end, a
negative one to the start). getBookmark/moveToBookmark keep both boundaries
as a path of child indices (an invalid bookmark gives S_OK and false).
IMarkupPointer2::MoveUnit handles the word end, sentence and address
(URL begin/end) actions and IsInsideURL answers for the text between two
pointers; an address is scheme://..., www. or mailto: text without the
punctuation that follows it.

